{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04272","headline":"和孙长史秋日卧病 · 骆宾王","name":"和孙长史秋日卧病","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霍第疏天府，潘园近帝台。\n调弦三妇至，置驿五侯来。\n尚想欢娱洽，吁嗟岁月催。\n金坛分上将，玉帐引瓌材。\n决胜鲸波静，腾谋鸟谷开。\n白云淮水外，紫陌灞陵隈。\n节变惊衰柳，笳繁思落梅。\n调神和玉烛，掞藻握珠胎。\n怅矣欣怀土，居然欲死灰。\n还因承雅曲，暂喜跃沈鳃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}